    }
    
    /* 强调文本 - 适度 */
    strong {
      color: #1e40af;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* 斜体文本 */
    em {
      color: #64748b;
      font-style: italic;
    }
    
    /* 分隔线 */
    hr {
      border: none;
      border-top: 2px solid #cbd5e1;
      margin: 32pt 0;
    }
    
    /* 内容区域 */
    .content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    
    /* 移除首行缩进的特殊情况 */
    .cover p, ul, ol, td, th, li {
      text-indent: 0;
    }
    
    /* 防止表格和列表被分页打断 */
    table, ul, ol {
      page-break-inside: avoid;
    }
    
    /* 章节标题前分页 */
    h2, h3 {
      page-break-after: avoid;
    }
    
    /* 水印效果 */
    .watermark {
      position: fixed;
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-45deg);
      font-size: 100px;
      color: rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.03);
      font-weight: 700;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: -1;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- 水印 -->
  <div class="watermark">技术方案</div>
  
  <!-- 封面页 -->
  <div class="cover">
    <div class="cover-title">技术方案</div>
    <div class="cover-subtitle">Technical Proposal</div>
    <div class="cover-info">
      <p>生成日期：2026年3月8日</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 40pt; font-size: 14pt; color: #1a56db; font-weight: 700;">智能报价管理系统</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 20pt; font-size: 11pt; opacity: 0.8;">Professional Solution System</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <!-- 正文 -->
  <div class="content">
    <!-- 页眉 -->
    <div class="header">
      <div class="header-title">技术方案</div>
      <div class="header-date">2026年3月8日</div>
    </div>
    
    <h1>垃圾转运站渗滤液处理项目技术方案</h1><h2>项目概述</h2>
本项目旨在为日处理10吨垃圾的转运站，设计一套高效、稳定、经济的渗滤液处理系统。方案将全面覆盖从设计依据到后期运维的全生命周期管理，确保出水达标排放或回用，满足环保要求。
<h2>系统设计依据</h2><ul><li><strong>设计规模</strong>：日处理渗滤液量 <strong>10 m³/d</strong>，按24小时连续运行设计，小时处理能力 *<em>0.42 m³/h<strong>。</strong></em></li><li> *<em>设计规范<strong>：方案遵循《生活垃圾填埋场污染控制标准》（GB 16889-2008）、《室外排水设计规范》（GB 50014-2021）及国家相关环保法规。</strong></em></li><li> *<em>设计原则<strong>：技术先进、运行稳定、操作简便、投资节省、占地集约。</li></ul><h2>设计进出水指标与排放要求</h2><table style="width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; border-collapse: collapse;"><thead><tr><th style="width: 25%">污染物指标</th><th style="width: 25%">设计进水浓度</th><th style="width: 25%">设计出水标准（一级A标准）</th><th style="width: 25%">去除率要求</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">污染物指标</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">设计进水浓度</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">设计出水标准（一级A标准）</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">去除率要求</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">CODcr</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">≤20000 mg/L</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">≤60 mg/L</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">≥99.7%</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">BOD5</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">≤10000 mg/L</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">≤10 mg/L</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">≥99.9%</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">NH3-N</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">≤1500 mg/L</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">≤5 (8) mg/L</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">≥99.7%</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">SS</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">≤800 mg/L</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">≤10 mg/L</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">≥98.8%</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">TN</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">≤2000 mg/L</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">≤15 mg/L</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">≥99.3%</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">pH值</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">5.0 - 8.0</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">6.0 - 9.0</td><td style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">-</td></tr></tbody></table></strong></em>
*<em>备注<strong>：出水标准参照《城镇污水处理厂污染物排放标准》（GB 18918-2002）一级A标准，括号外数值为水温>12℃时的控制指标。
<h2>工艺比选与确定</h2>
针对垃圾渗滤液高COD、高氨氮、可生化性尚可但水质波动大的特点，进行工艺比选：
<table style="width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; border-collapse: collapse;"><thead><tr><th style="width: 20%">工艺方案</th><th style="width: 20%">核心工艺</th><th style="width: 20%">优点</th><th style="width: 20%">缺点</th><th style="width: 20%">适用性分析</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">工艺方案</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">核心工艺</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">优点</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">缺点</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">适用性分析</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">方案一</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">两级A/O + MBR + 纳滤(NF)</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">脱氮除碳效率高，出水水质优且稳定，抗冲击负荷强，自动化程度高。</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">投资及运行成本相对较高，膜组件需定期清洗更换。</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">*<em>推荐<strong>。特别适合中小规模、高标准的渗滤液处理项目，能确保稳定达标。</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">方案二</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">混凝沉淀 + 水解酸化 + 接触氧化</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">投资较低，工艺相对简单。</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">出水稳定性较差，难以应对高氨氮，占地面积较大，污泥产量高。</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">适用于排放标准较低或预算极其有限的场景。</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">方案三</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">蒸发结晶（MVR）</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">减量化彻底，出水可回用，不受原水水质波动影响。</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">能耗极高，投资巨大，易结垢，运行维护复杂。</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">适用于零排放要求或浓缩液最终处置。</td></tr></tbody></table></strong></em><strong>结论</strong>：综合技术可靠性、达标保障及本项目规模，*<em>推荐采用“预处理 + 两级A/O + MBR + 纳滤(NF)”组合工艺<strong>作为本方案的核心。
<h2>工艺流程说明</strong></em></h2><ul><li><strong>预处理单元</strong>：渗滤液原水经<strong>格栅</strong>去除大颗粒杂物后，进入*<em>调节池<strong>，均质均量，缓冲水质水量波动。</strong></em></li><li><strong>生化处理单元</strong>：调节池出水提升至*<em>两级A/O生化池<strong>。一级A/O主要进行高效碳氧化和部分硝化反硝化；二级A/O进一步深度脱氮。利用微生物降解绝大部分有机物和氨氮。</strong></em></li><li><strong>膜分离单元</strong>：生化池混合液进入*<em>MBR膜池<strong>，利用膜组件实现泥水高效分离，出水清澈，污泥被完全截留，生化系统可维持高浓度活性污泥。</strong></em></li><li><strong>深度处理单元</strong>：MBR产水进入*<em>纳滤(NF)系统<strong>，截留难降解有机物、色度及部分二价盐离子，确保COD、色度等指标稳定达标。</strong></em></li><li><strong>污泥处理单元</strong>：系统产生的剩余污泥排入<strong>污泥池</strong>，经*<em>叠螺脱水机<strong>脱水后，泥饼外运处置。</strong></em></li><li><strong>辅助系统</strong>：配套<strong>加药系统</strong>（碳源、酸碱、PAC/PAM）、<strong>仪表与自动控制系统</strong>、*<em>臭气收集与处理系统<strong>。</li></ul><h2>占地面积估算</strong></em></h2>
整套处理系统采用一体化撬装或模块化钢结构设计，预计总占地面积约为：*<em>长15m × 宽8m = 120平方米<strong>。可根据现场地形灵活布置。
<h2>运行成本分析（估算）</h2><table style="width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; border-collapse: collapse;"><thead><tr><th style="width: 20%">成本项</th><th style="width: 20%">单位消耗量</th><th style="width: 20%">单价</th><th style="width: 20%">日运行成本（元/天）</th><th style="width: 20%">吨水处理成本（元/吨）</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">成本项</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">单位消耗量</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">单价</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">日运行成本（元/天）</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">吨水处理成本（元/吨）</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">电费</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">约80 kWh/d</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">0.8元/kWh</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">64.0</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">6.4</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">药剂费（碳源、酸碱等）</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">-</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">-</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">40.0</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">4.0</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">膜更换摊销</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">-</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">-</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">25.0</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">2.5</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">人工费（0.5人编制）</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">-</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">300元/人·天</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">150.0</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">15.0</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">维护费及其他</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">-</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">-</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">21.0</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">2.1</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;"><strong>合计</strong></td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">-</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">-</td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;"><strong>300.0</strong></td><td style="width: 20%; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;">*<em>30.0<strong></td></tr></tbody></table></strong></em><strong>备注</strong>：吨水处理成本约为 *<em>30元/吨<strong>。人工费占比最高，若实现无人值守或兼管，成本可显著下降。
